# CRC32—Accumulate CRC32 Value -- override
# The manual's Operation spells out CRC-32C (the Castagnoli polynomial
# 11EDC6F41H, bit-reflected) as BIT_REFLECT/MOD2 steps followed by prose
# notes; v1's ALU computes the same CRC (Crc32). The 64-bit forms
# zero-extend the 32-bit CRC.
@operation
DEST := Crc32(DEST, SRC);
